meta {
  name: Update profile calorie and macro limits
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

put {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/profile
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "dailyCalorieLimit": 2200,
    "dailyProteinLimit": 110,
    "dailyCarbohydratesLimit": 275,
    "dailyFatLimit": 73
  }
}

docs {
  Update the signed-in user's calorie and macro limits. All values must be integers from 1 to 100000. The app derives macro grams using the default 20/30/50 calorie split when calories change; changing macro grams recalculates calories at 4 kcal/g for protein and carbohydrates and 9 kcal/g for fat.

  Example response:
  {
    "dailyCalorieLimit": 2200,
    "dailyProteinLimit": 110,
    "dailyCarbohydratesLimit": 275,
    "dailyFatLimit": 73
  }
}
